Taux de Conversion de Page avec les Outils d...","de":"Page Conversion Rate Optimierung mit AI Agent Tools","pt":"Otimização de Taxa de Conversão de Página: Guia de Config...","ru":"ИИ Агенты для оптимизации конверсии страниц: Руководство","ar":"أداة تحسين معدل تحويل الصفحة: دليل الإعداد"},"description":{"en":"Unlock the full potential of your marketing pages with page-cro. Discover how to analyze and improve conversion rates with actionable recommendations - get s...","zh":"了解 Page-CRO 的技术细节和最佳实践，提高转化率和用户体验","ja":"Page-CRO の技術的詳細とベストプラクティスを学び、コンバージョン率とユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","ko":"Page-CRO의 기술적 세부 사항과 최선의 관행을 학습하여 전환률과 사용자 경험을 향상시키세요","es":"Aprende a mejorar el rendimiento de tus páginas de marketing con recomendaciones de expertos en optimización de conversión","fr":"Découvrez comment améliorer les performances de vos pages de marketing avec des recommandations d''experts en optimisation de conversion","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Leistung Ihrer Marketingseiten mit Empfehlungen von Experten für Conversion-Rate-Optimierung verbessern können","pt":"Aprenda a melhorar a taxa de conversão da página com nossa ferramenta de otimização. Obtenha dicas e recomendações para aumentar a eficácia da sua página","ru":"Узнайте, как улучшить коэффициент конверсии страницы с помощью наших ИИ Агентов. Получите советы и рекомендации, чтобы повысить эффективность вашей страницы","ar":"تعلم كيف تحسن معدل تحويل الصفحة باستخدام أداة التحسين الخاصة بنا. احصل على نصائح وتوصيات لزيادة فعالية صفحتك"},"definition":{"en":"page-cro is a conversion rate optimization expert skill that analyzes marketing pages to provide actionable recommendations for improvement","zh":"Page-CRO 是一种通过分析和优化页面元素来提高转化率的技术","ja":"Page-CRO は、ページ要素を分析して最適化することでコンバージョン率を向上させる技術です","ko":"Page-CRO는 페이지 요소를 분석하고 최적화하여 전환률을 향상시키는 기술입니다","es":"La optimización de conversión de página es el proceso de mejorar la eficacia de una página web para lograr un objetivo específico","fr":"L''optimisation de conversion de page est le processus d''amélioration de l''efficacité d''une page web pour atteindre un objectif spécifique","de":"Die Conversion-Rate-Optimierung ist der Prozess der Verbesserung der Effizienz einer Webseite, um ein bestimmtes Ziel zu erreichen","pt":"Otimização de taxa de conversão de página é o processo de melhorar a eficácia de uma página para aumentar as conversões","ru":"Оптимизация конверсии страницы - это процесс улучшения эффективности страницы для увеличения конверсий","ar":"تحسين معدل تحويل الصفحة هو عملية تحسين فعالية صفحة لزيادة التحويلات"},"features":{"en":["Checks for product marketing context in .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Identifies key page elements for conversion rate optimization","Provides actionable recommendations for improvement","Analyzes marketing pages for conversion rate optimization opportunities","Reads context from .claude/product-marketing-context.md before asking questions"],"zh":["基于产品营销上下文的分析","页面元素的可行优化建议","使用 .claude/product-marketing-context.md 进行上下文分析","支持多种页面类型的优化","提供详细的转化率分析报告"],"ja":["プロダクトマーケティングコンテキストに基づく分析","ページ要素の実行可能な最適化提案",".claude/product-marketing-context.md を使用したコンテキスト分析","複数のページタイプの最適化をサポート","詳細なコンバージョン率分析レポートの提供"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 기반으로 분석","페이지 요소의 실행 가능한 최적화 제안",".claude/product-marketing-context.md를 사용한 컨텍스트 분석","다중 페이지 유형의 최적화를 지원","상세한 전환률 분석 보고서 제공"],"es":["Análisis de páginas de marketing","Recomendaciones para mejorar la tasa de conversión","Uso de contexto de marketing de productos","Identificación de elementos de página clave"],"fr":["Analyse de pages de marketing","Recommandations pour améliorer le taux de conversion","Utilisation du contexte de marketing de produits","Identification d''éléments de page clés"],"de":["Analyse von Marketingseiten","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Konversionsrate","Verwendung von Produktmarketing-Kontext","Identifizierung von Schlüsselelementen auf der Seite"],"pt":["Análise de contexto de marketing de produto","Identificação de oportunidades de melhoria na página","Fornecimento de recomendações para melhorar a taxa de conversão","Integração com tecnologias como CLI","Análise de página para otimização de conversão"],"ru":["Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта","Определение возможностей для улучшения страницы","Предоставление рекомендаций для улучшения коэффициента конверсии","Интеграция с технологиями như CLI","Анализ страницы для оптимизации конверсии"],"ar":["تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج","تحديد فرص التحسين في الصفحة","توفير توصيات لتحسين معدل التحويل","التكامل مع التقنيات مثل CLI","تحليل الصفحة لتحسين التحويل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use page-cro","what is page-cro","page-cro alternative","page-cro vs conversion rate optimization tools","page-cro install","page-cro setup guide","conversion rate optimization best practices","marketing page analysis","actionable recommendations for conversion rate improvement"],"zh":["Page-CRO","转化率优化","页面分析","AI工具","产品营销上下文","页面元素优化","转化率分析报告"],"ja":["Page-CRO","コンバージョン率最適化","ページ分析","AIエージェント","プロダクトマーケティングコンテキスト","ページ要素最適化","コンバージョン率分析レポート"],"ko":["Page-CRO","전환률 최적화","페이지 분석","AI 에이전트","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트","페이지 요소 최적화","전환률 분석 보고서"],"es":["optimización de conversión de página","herramientas de ai agent","marketing de productos","análisis de páginas web","mejora de la tasa de conversión","recomendaciones de expertos"],"fr":["amélioration du taux de conversion de page","outils d''agent ia","marketing de produits","analyse de pages web","amélioration du taux de conversion","recommandations d''experts"],"de":["conversion-rate-optimierung","ai agent tools","produktmarketing","analyse von webseiten","verbesserung der konversionsrate","empfehlungen von experten"],"pt":["otimização de taxa de conversão de página","ferramenta de otimização de página","melhorar taxa de conversão","recomendações de otimização","análise de contexto de marketing de produto","CLI","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["оптимизация конверсии страницы","инструмент оптимизации страницы","улучшить коэффициент конверсии","рекомендации по оптимизации","анализ контекста маркетинга продукта","CLI","веб-разработка"],"ar":["تحسين معدل تحويل الصفحة","أداة تحسين الصفحة","تحسين معدل التحويل","توصيات التحسين","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج","CLI","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"Monsoft-Solutions","repo":"alluring-website-v1","repoPath":"Monsoft-Solutions/alluring-website-v1","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.329Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"page-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize, improve, or increase conversions on any marketing page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, or blog posts. Also use when the user says CRO, conversion rate optimization, this page isnt converting, improve conversions, or why isnt this page working. For signup/registration flows, see signup-flow-cro. For post-signup activation, see onboarding-cro. For forms outside of signup, see form-cro. For popups/modals, see popup-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)\n\nYou are a conversion rate optimization expert. Your goal is to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Page","body":"# Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)\n\nYou are a conversion rate optimization expert. Your goal is to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Page Type**: Homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, blog, about, other\n2. **Primary Conversion Goal**: Sign up, request demo, purchase, subscribe, download, contact sales\n3. **Traffic Context**: Where are visitors coming from? (organic, paid, email, social)\n\n---\n\n## CRO Analysis Framework\n\nAnalyze the page across these dimensions, in order of impact:\n\n### 1. Value Proposition Clarity (Highest Impact)\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- Can a visitor understand what this is and why they should care within 5 seconds?\n- Is the primary benefit clear, specific, and differentiated?\n- Is it written in the customer''s language (not company jargon)?\n\n**Common issues:**\n\n- Feature-focused instead of benefit-focused\n- Too vague or too clever (sacrificing clarity)\n- Trying to say everything instead of the most important thing\n\n### 2. Headline Effectiveness\n\n**Evaluate:**\n\n- Does it communicate the core value proposition?\n- Is it specific enough to be meaningful?\n- Does it match the traffic source''s messaging?\n\n**Strong headline patterns:**\n\n- Outcome-focused: \"Get [desired outcome] without [pain point]\"\n- Specificity: Include numbers, timeframes, or concrete details\n- Social proof: \"Join 10,000+ teams who...\"\n\n### 3. CTA Placement, Copy, and Hierarchy\n\n**Primary CTA assessment:**\n\n- Is there one clear primary action?\n- Is it visible without scrolling?\n- Does the button copy communicate value, not just action?\n    - Weak: \"Submit,\" \"Sign Up,\" \"Learn More\"\n    - Strong: \"Start Free Trial,\" \"Get My Report,\" \"See Pricing\"\n\n**CTA hierarchy:**\n\n- Is there a logical primary vs. secondary CTA structure?\n- Are CTAs repeated at key decision points?\n\n### 4. Visual Hierarchy and Scannability\n\n**Check:**\n\n- Can someone scanning get the main message?\n- Are the most important elements visually prominent?\n- Is there enough white space?\n- Do images support or distract from the message?\n\n### 5. Trust Signals and Social Proof\n\n**Types to look for:**\n\n- Customer logos (especially recognizable ones)\n- Testimonials (specific, attributed, with photos)\n- Case study snippets with real numbers\n- Review scores and counts\n- Security badges (where relevant)\n\n**Placement:** Near CTAs and after benefit claims\n\n### 6. Objection Handling\n\n**Common objections to address:**\n\n- Price/value concerns\n- \"Will this work for my situation?\"\n- Implementation difficulty\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n\n**Address through:** FAQ sections, guarantees, comparison content, process transparency\n\n### 7. Friction Points\n\n**Look for:**\n\n- Too many form fields\n- Unclear next steps\n- Confusing navigation\n- Required information that shouldn''t be required\n- Mobile experience issues\n- Long load times\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nStructure your recommendations as:\n\n### Quick Wins (Implement Now)\n\nEasy changes with likely immediate impact.\n\n### High-Impact Changes (Prioritize)\n\nBigger changes that require more effort but will significantly improve conversions.\n\n### Test Ideas\n\nHypotheses worth A/B testing rather than assuming.\n\n### Copy Alternatives\n\nFor key elements (headlines, CTAs), provide 2-3 alternatives with rationale.\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Frameworks\n\n### Homepage CRO\n\n- Clear positioning for cold visitors\n- Quick path to most common conversion\n- Handle both \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page CRO\n\n- Message match with traffic source\n- Single CTA (remove navigation if possible)\n- Complete argument on one page\n\n### Pricing Page CRO\n\n- Clear plan comparison\n- Recommended plan indication\n- Address \"which plan is right for me?\" anxiety\n\n### Feature Page CRO\n\n- Connect feature to benefit\n- Use cases and examples\n- Clear path to try/buy\n\n### Blog Post CRO\n\n- Contextual CTAs matching content topic\n- Inline CTAs at natural stopping points\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\nWhen recommending experiments, consider tests for:\n\n- Hero section (headline, visual, CTA)\n- Trust signals and social proof placement\n- Pricing presentation\n- Form optimization\n- Navigation and UX\n\n**For comprehensive experiment ideas by page type**: See [references/experiments.md](references/experiments.md)\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current conversion rate and goal?\n2. Where is traffic coming from?\n3. What does your signup/purchase flow look like after this page?\n4. Do you have user research, heatmaps, or session recordings?\n5. What have you already tried?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **signup-flow-cro**: If the issue is in the signup process itself\n- **form-cro**: If forms on the page need optimization\n- **popup-cro**: If considering popups as part of the strategy\n- **copywriting**: If the page needs a complete copy rewrite\n- **ab-test-setup**: To properly test recommended changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:10.269Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Analysis Agents needing advanced page conversion rate optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级页面转化率优化能力的营销分析代理","ja":"マーケティング分析エージェントが高度なページ転換率最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 페이지 전환률 최적화 기능이 필요한 마케팅 분석 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de marketing que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de la tasa de conversión de páginas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de marketing ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation du taux de conversion de pages.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Optimierung der Konvertierungsrate von Seiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Marketing que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização da taxa de conversão de páginas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Маркетинговых Аналитических Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации коэффициента конверсии страниц.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين معدل تحويل الصفحات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates, utilizing product marketing context and identifying key page elements like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files.","zh":"赋予代理分析营销页面并提供可行的建议以提高转换率的能力，利用产品营销背景并识别关键页面元素，如 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 文件","ja":"エージェントがマーケティングページを分析し、転換率を向上させるための実行可能な推奨事項を提供する機能を提供し、製品マーケティングコンテキストを利用し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ファイルなどの重要なページ要素を識別する","ko":"에이전트가 마케팅 페이지를 분석하고 전환률을 향상시키기 위한 행동 가능한 추천을 제공하는 기능을 제공하며, 제품 마케팅 콘텍스트를 활용하고 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일과 같은 주요 페이지 요소를 식별","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar páginas de marketing y proporcionar recomendaciones accionables para mejorar las tasas de conversión, utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos y identificando elementos de página clave como archivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les pages de marketing et de fournir des recommandations actionnables pour améliorer les taux de conversion, en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits et en identifiant les éléments de page clés tels que les fichiers `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Marketingseiten zu analysieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Konvertierungsraten bereitzustellen, unter Nutzung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts und Identifizierung von Schlüsselelementen der Seite wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`-Dateien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar páginas de marketing e fornecer recomendações práticas para melhorar as taxas de conversão, utilizando o contexto de marketing de produto e identificando elementos de página importantes como arquivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать маркетинговые страницы и предоставлять действенные рекомендации для улучшения коэффициентов конверсии, используя контекст маркетинга продукта и определяя ключевые элементы страницы, такие как файлы `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تحليل صفحات التسويق وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين معدلات التحويل، باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج وتحديد عناصر الصفحة الرئيسية مثل ملفات `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing marketing pages for optimization opportunities","Generating recommendations to improve conversion rates","Identifying key page elements for product marketing context"],"zh":["分析营销页面以查找优化机会","生成提高转换率的建议","识别产品营销背景的关键页面元素"],"ja":["最適化の機会を探すためにマーケティングページを分析する","転換率を向上させるための推奨事項を生成する","製品マーケティングコンテキストの重要なページ要素を識別する"],"ko":["최적화 기회를 찾기 위해 마케팅 페이지를 분석","전환률을 향상시키기 위한 추천을 생성","제품 마케팅 콘텍스트의 주요 페이지 요소를 식별"],"es":["Análisis de páginas de marketing para oportunidades de optimización","Generación de recomendaciones para mejorar las tasas de conversión","Identificación de elementos de página clave para el contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Analyse de pages de marketing pour les opportunités d''optimisation","Génération de recommandations pour améliorer les taux de conversion","Identification d''éléments de page clés pour le contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Analyse von Marketingseiten für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten","Generierung von Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Konvertierungsraten","Identifizierung von Schlüsselelementen der Seite für den Produktmarketing-Kontext"],"pt":["Analisar páginas de marketing para oportunidades de otimização","Gerar recomendações para melhorar as taxas de conversão","Identificar elementos de página importantes para o contexto de marketing de produto"],"ru":["Анализ маркетинговых страниц для выявления возможностей оптимизации","Генерировать рекомендации для улучшения коэффициентов конверсии","Определение ключевых элементов страницы для контекста маркетинга продукта"],"ar":["تحليل صفحات التسويق لفرص تحسين","توليد توصيات لتحسين معدلات التحويل","تحديد عناصر الصفحة الرئيسية لسياق تسويق المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to marketing page content","Dependent on existence of `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files for context"],"zh":["需要访问营销页面内容","依赖 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 文件的存在以获取背景"],"ja":["マーケティングページコンテンツへのアクセスが必要","背景を取得するために `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ファイルの存在に依存する"],"ko":["마케팅 페이지 콘텐츠에 대한 액세스가 필요","백그라운드 정보를 얻기 위해 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일의 존재에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al contenido de las páginas de marketing","Dependiente de la existencia de archivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para el contexto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au contenu des pages de marketing","Dépendante de l''existence de fichiers `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour le contexte"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Inhalt der Marketingseiten","Abhängig von der Existenz von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`-Dateien für den Kontext"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao conteúdo da página de marketing","Dependente da existência de arquivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к контенту маркетинговой страницы","Зависит от существования файлов `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى محتوى صفحة التسويق","يعتمد على وجود ملفات `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للسياق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b9d4d2e37d7c90ad73ff1b56c58ef2a92cfdc4f2a4a104941c17ed684f84022e","qualityScore":46}');
