 مثبتة"},"definition":{"en":"marketing-ideas is a skill that offers a library of proven marketing strategies for SaaS, utilizing product marketing context to inform campaign decisions.","zh":"Marketing Ideas是AI工具，提供139个经过验证的营销策略，帮助用户找到适合特定情况、阶段和资源的营销策略","ja":"Marketing IdeasはAIエージェントであり、139の検証済みマーケティング戦略を提供し、ユーザーが特定の状況、段階、リソースに適したマーケティング戦略を見つけるのに役立ちます","ko":"Marketing Ideas는 AI 에이전트로, 139개의 검증된 마케팅 전략을 제공하여 사용자가 특정 상황, 단계 및 자원에 적합한 마케팅 전략을 찾는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"¿Qué es marketing-ideas? Es una habilidad de AI que proporciona ideas de marketing probadas para SaaS","fr":"Qu''est-ce que marketing-ideas? C''est une compétence d''IA qui propose des idées de marketing éprouvées pour SaaS","de":"Was ist marketing-ideas? Es ist eine KI-Fähigkeit, die bewährte Marketingideen für SaaS bereitstellt","pt":"O que é Marketing-Ideas? É um skill que fornece ideias de marketing comprovadas para desenvolvedores","ru":"Что такое Marketing-Ideas? Это навык, который предоставляет проверенные маркетинговые идеи для разработчиков","ar":"ما هي Marketing-Ideas؟ هي مهارة توفر أفكار تسويقية مثبتة للمطورين"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes product marketing context from .agents/product-marketing-context.md files","Provides 139 proven marketing ideas for SaaS","Helps users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources","Supports reading of .claude/product-marketing-context.md files in older setups","Enables users to ask targeted questions based on existing context"],"zh":["139个经过验证的营销策略","支持product-marketing-context.md文件","根据特定情况、阶段和资源提供营销策略","使用CLI或React进行集成","支持Python脚本"],"ja":["139の検証済みマーケティング戦略","product-marketing-context.mdファイルをサポート","特定の状況、段階、リソースに応じたマーケティング戦略を提供","CLIまたはReactを使用した統合","Pythonスクリプトをサポート"],"ko":["139개의 검증된 마케팅 전략","product-marketing-context.md 파일 지원","특정 상황, 단계 및 자원에 적합한 마케팅 전략 제공","CLI 또는 React를 사용한 통합","Python 스크립트 지원"],"es":["139 ideas de marketing probadas","Contexto de marketing de producto","Compatibilidad con setups anteriores","Integración con archivos de contexto de marketing","Soporte para múltiples escenarios de marketing"],"fr":["139 idées de marketing éprouvées","Contexte de marketing de produit","Compatibilité avec les anciens setups","Intégration avec les fichiers de contexte de marketing","Support pour plusieurs scénarios de marketing"],"de":["139 bewährte Marketingideen","Produktmarketing-Kontext","Kompatibilität mit älteren Setups","Integration mit Marketing-Kontext-Dateien","Unterstützung für mehrere Marketing-Szenarien"],"pt":["Biblioteca de 139 ideias de marketing comprovadas","Contexto de marketing de produto personalizado","Integração com .agents/product-marketing-context.md","Suporte para múltiplos estágios e recursos","Interface de programação de aplicativos (API) para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Библиотека из 139 проверенных маркетинговых идей","Персонализированный контекст продукта маркетинга","Интеграция с .agents/product-marketing-context.md","Поддержка нескольких стадий и ресурсов","Интерфейс программирования приложений (API) для разработчиков"],"ar":["مكتبة من 139 فكرة تسويقية مثبتة","سياق تسويقي منتج مخصص","التكامل مع .agents/product-marketing-context.md","دعم للعديد من المراحل والموارد","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات (API) للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use marketing-ideas","what is marketing-ideas","marketing-ideas alternative","marketing-ideas vs competitor","marketing-ideas install","marketing-ideas setup guide","SaaS marketing strategies","product marketing context"],"zh":["Marketing Ideas","AI工具","营销策略","product-marketing-context.md","CLI","React","Python","AI营销","数字营销"],"ja":["Marketing Ideas","AIエージェント","マーケティング戦略","product-marketing-context.md","CLI","React","Python","AIマーケティング","デジタルマーケティング"],"ko":["Marketing Ideas","AI 에이전트","마케팅 전략","product-marketing-context.md","CLI","React","Python","AI 마케팅","디지털 마케팅"],"es":["herramientas de AI para marketing","ideas de marketing para SaaS","configuración de marketing","estrategias de marketing para SaaS","marketing de producto","contexto de marketing"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le marketing","idées de marketing pour SaaS","configuration de marketing","stratégies de marketing pour SaaS","marketing de produit","contexte de marketing"],"de":["KI-Tools für Marketing","Marketingideen für SaaS","Marketing-Konfiguration","Marketing-Strategien für SaaS","Produktmarketing","Marketing-Kontext"],"pt":["Marketing-Ideas","Desenvolvimento de marketing","Estratégias de marketing","Técnicas de marketing","Ferramentas de marketing","Biblioteca de marketing","Contexto de marketing de produto","API de marketing"],"ru":["Marketing-Ideas","Разработка маркетинга","Маркетинговые стратегии","Маркетинговые техники","Маркетинговые инструменты","Библиотека маркетинга","Контекст продукта маркетинга","API маркетинга"],"ar":["Marketing-Ideas","تطوير التسويق","استراتيجيات التسويق","تقنيات التسويق","أدوات التسويق","مكتبة التسويق","سياق منتج التسويق","API التسويق"]}},"owner":"remote-123","repo":"v0-real-estate-landing-page","repoPath":"remote-123/v0-real-estate-landing-page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T05:37:16Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"marketing-ideas","description":"When the user needs marketing ideas, inspiration, or strategies for their SaaS or software product. Also use when the user asks for marketing ideas, growth ideas, how to market, marketing strategies, marketing tactics, ways to promote, or ideas to grow. This skill provides 139 proven marketing approaches organized by category.","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.agents/product-marketing-context.md` exists (or `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` in older setups), read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already cover","body":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.agents/product-marketing-context.md` exists (or `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` in older setups), read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nWhen asked for marketing ideas:\n1. Ask about their product, audience, and current stage if not clear\n2. Suggest 3-5 most relevant ideas based on their context\n3. Provide details on implementation for chosen ideas\n4. Consider their resources (time, budget, team size)\n\n---\n\n## Ideas by Category (Quick Reference)\n\n| Category | Ideas | Examples |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| Content & SEO | 1-10 | Programmatic SEO, Glossary marketing, Content repurposing |\n| Competitor | 11-13 | Comparison pages, Marketing jiu-jitsu |\n| Free Tools | 14-22 | Calculators, Generators, Chrome extensions |\n| Paid Ads | 23-34 | LinkedIn, Google, Retargeting, Podcast ads |\n| Social & Community | 35-44 | LinkedIn audience, Reddit marketing, Short-form video |\n| Email | 45-53 | Founder emails, Onboarding sequences, Win-back |\n| Partnerships | 54-64 | Affiliate programs, Integration marketing, Newsletter swaps |\n| Events | 65-72 | Webinars, Conference speaking, Virtual summits |\n| PR & Media | 73-76 | Press coverage, Documentaries |\n| Launches | 77-86 | Product Hunt, Lifetime deals, Giveaways |\n| Product-Led | 87-96 | Viral loops, Powered-by marketing, Free migrations |\n| Content Formats | 97-109 | Podcasts, Courses, Annual reports, Year wraps |\n| Unconventional | 110-122 | Awards, Challenges, Guerrilla marketing |\n| Platforms | 123-130 | App marketplaces, Review sites, YouTube |\n| International | 131-132 | Expansion, Price localization |\n| Developer | 133-136 | DevRel, Certifications |\n| Audience-Specific | 137-139 | Referrals, Podcast tours, Customer language |\n\n**For the complete list with descriptions**: See [references/ideas-by-category.md](references/ideas-by-category.md)\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Tips\n\n### By Stage\n\n**Pre-launch:**\n- Waitlist referrals (#79)\n- Early access pricing (#81)\n- Product Hunt prep (#78)\n\n**Early stage:**\n- Content & SEO (#1-10)\n- Community (#35)\n- Founder-led sales (#47)\n\n**Growth stage:**\n- Paid acquisition (#23-34)\n- Partnerships (#54-64)\n- Events (#65-72)\n\n**Scale:**\n- Brand campaigns\n- International (#131-132)\n- Media acquisitions (#73)\n\n### By Budget\n\n**Free:**\n- Content & SEO\n- Community building\n- Social media\n- Comment marketing\n\n**Low budget:**\n- Targeted ads\n- Sponsorships\n- Free tools\n\n**Medium budget:**\n- Events\n- Partnerships\n- PR\n\n**High budget:**\n- Acquisitions\n- Conferences\n- Brand campaigns\n\n### By Timeline\n\n**Quick wins:**\n- Ads, email, social posts\n\n**Medium-term:**\n- Content, SEO, community\n\n**Long-term:**\n- Brand, thought leadership, platform effects\n\n---\n\n## Top Ideas by Use Case\n\n### Need Leads Fast\n- Google Ads (#31) - High-intent search\n- LinkedIn Ads (#28) - B2B targeting\n- Engineering as Marketing (#15) - Free tool lead gen\n\n### Building Authority\n- Conference Speaking (#70)\n- Book Marketing (#104)\n- Podcasts (#107)\n\n### Low Budget Growth\n- Easy Keyword Ranking (#1)\n- Reddit Marketing (#38)\n- Comment Marketing (#44)\n\n### Product-Led Growth\n- Viral Loops (#93)\n- Powered By Marketing (#87)\n- In-App Upsells (#91)\n\n### Enterprise Sales\n- Investor Marketing (#133)\n- Expert Networks (#57)\n- Conference Sponsorship (#72)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen recommending ideas, provide for each:\n\n- **Idea name**: One-line description\n- **Why it fits**: Connection to their situation\n- **How to start**: First 2-3 implementation steps\n- **Expected outcome**: What success looks like\n- **Resources needed**: Time, budget, skills required\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current stage and main growth goal?\n2. What''s your marketing budget and team size?\n3. What have you already tried that worked or didn''t?\n4. What competitor tactics do you admire?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For scaling SEO content (#4)\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison pages (#11)\n- **email-sequence**: For email marketing tactics\n- **free-tool-strategy**: For engineering as marketing (#15)\n- **referral-program**: For viral growth (#93)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:17:11.224Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SaaS-focused AI Agents needing diverse marketing strategy suggestions.","zh":"非常适合需要多样化营销策略建议的SaaS焦点AI代理。","ja":"SaaSに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが多様なマーケティング戦略の提案を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"다양한 마케팅 전략 제안이 필요한 SaaS 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA centrados en SaaS que necesitan sugerencias de estrategias de marketing diversas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur le SaaS ayant besoin de suggestions de stratégies de marketing diversifiées.","de":"Perfekt für SaaS-fokussierte KI-Agents, die diverse Marketingstrategie-Vorschläge benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em SaaS que precisam de sugestões de estratégias de marketing diversas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на SaaS, которым необходимы разные предложения маркетинговых стратегий.","ar":"مثالي لعمال الإي الأيتام الذين يركزون على SaaS وهم بحاجة إلى اقتراحات استراتيجية تسويقية متنوعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate tailored marketing plans using 139 proven strategies, incorporating product marketing context from .agents/product-marketing-context.md files and providing stage-specific advice for optimal resource allocation.","zh":"赋予代理生成量身定制的营销计划的能力，使用139种经过验证的策略，集成产品营销背景从.agents/product-marketing-context.md文件，并为最佳资源分配提供阶段特定的建议。","ja":"139の検証済みの戦略を使用して、.agents/product-marketing-context.mdファイルからの製品マーケティングのコンテキストを組み込み、最適なリソース割り当てのための段階特定のアドバイスを提供することで、エージェントがカスタマイズされたマーケティングプランを生成できるようにします。","ko":"139개의 검증된 전략을 사용하여 .agents/product-marketing-context.md 파일에서 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 통합하고 최적의 리소스 할당을 위한 단계별 조언을 제공하여 에이전트가 맞춤형 마케팅 계획을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar planes de marketing personalizados utilizando 139 estrategias probadas, incorporando el contexto de marketing de productos de los archivos .agents/product-marketing-context.md y brindando asesoramiento específico de fase para una asignación óptima de recursos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des plans de marketing personnalisés en utilisant 139 stratégies éprouvées, en incorporant le contexte de marketing de produit à partir des fichiers .agents/product-marketing-context.md et en fournissant des conseils spécifiques à chaque étape pour une allocation optimale des ressources.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, maßgeschneiderte Marketingpläne zu erstellen, indem 139 bewährte Strategien verwendet werden, den Produktmarketing-Kontext aus den Dateien .agents/product-marketing-context.md einbeziehen und phase-spezifische Beratung für eine optimale Ressourcenverteilung bieten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar planos de marketing personalizados usando 139 estratégias comprovadas, incorporando o contexto de marketing de produtos de arquivos .agents/product-marketing-context.md e fornecendo conselhos específicos de estágio para alocação ótima de recursos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать индивидуальные маркетинговые планы с использованием 139 проверенных стратегий, включающих контекст маркетинга продукта из файлов .agents/product-marketing-context.md и предоставляющих этапно-специфические рекомендации для оптимального распределения ресурсов.","ar":"يمنح العمال الإي القدرة على توليد خطط تسويقية مخصصة باستخدام 139 استراتيجية مثبتة، وتضمين سياق تسويق المنتج من ملفات .agents/product-marketing-context.md وتوفير نصائح محددة لكل مرحلة لتحقيق تخصيص مثالي للموارد."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating targeted SaaS marketing campaigns","Identifying resource-efficient marketing strategies","Developing stage-specific marketing plans"],"zh":["生成针对性的SaaS营销活动","识别资源高效的营销策略","开发阶段特定的营销计划"],"ja":["ターゲットを絞ったSaaSマーケティングキャンペーンを生成する","リソース効率の高いマーケティング戦略を特定する","段階特定のマーケティングプランを開発する"],"ko":["목적을 가진 SaaS 마케팅 캠페인을 생성","리소스 효율적인 마케팅 전략을 식별","단계별 마케팅 계획을 개발"],"es":["Generación de campañas de marketing de SaaS dirigidas","Identificación de estrategias de marketing eficientes en términos de recursos","Desarrollo de planes de marketing específicos de fase"],"fr":["Génération de campagnes de marketing SaaS ciblées","Identification de stratégies de marketing efficaces en termes de ressources","Développement de plans de marketing spécifiques à chaque étape"],"de":["Generierung gezielter SaaS-Marketingkampagnen","Identifizierung ressourceneffizienter Marketingstrategien","Entwicklung phase-spezifischer Marketingpläne"],"pt":["Geração de campanhas de marketing de SaaS direcionadas","Identificação de estratégias de marketing eficientes em termos de recursos","Desenvolvimento de planos de marketing específicos de estágio"],"ru":["Генерация целевых кампаний по маркетингу SaaS","Определение ресурсо-эффективных маркетинговых стратегий","Разработка этапно-специфических маркетинговых планов"],"ar":["توليد حملات تسويقية مخصصة لبرامج SaaS","تحديد استراتيجيات تسويقية كفئة في استخدام الموارد","تطوير خطط تسويقية محددة لكل مرحلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context file (.agents/product-marketing-context.md) for optimal performance","Limited to SaaS marketing strategies"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景文件(.agents/product-marketing-context.md)以获得最佳性能","仅限SaaS营销策略"],"ja":[".agents/product-marketing-context.mdファイルが必要なため、最適なパフォーマンスが得られます","SaaSマーケティング戦略のみ"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 위해 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일(.agents/product-marketing-context.md)가 필요","SaaS 마케팅 전략만"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de contexto de marketing de productos (.agents/product-marketing-context.md) para un rendimiento óptimo","Limitado a estrategias de marketing de SaaS"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de contexte de marketing de produit (.agents/product-marketing-context.md) pour des performances optimales","Limité aux stratégies de marketing SaaS"],"de":["Benötigt eine Produktmarketing-Kontext-Datei (.agents/product-marketing-context.md) für optimale Leistung","Begrenzt auf SaaS-Marketingstrategien"],"pt":["Requer arquivo de contexto de marketing de produtos (.agents/product-marketing-context.md) para desempenho ótimo","Limitado a estratégias de marketing de SaaS"],"ru":["Требует файла контекста маркетинга продукта (.agents/product-marketing-context.md) для оптимальной производительности","Ограничен маркетинговыми стратегиями SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف سياق تسويق المنتج (.agents/product-marketing-context.md) للأداء الأمثل","محدود بالاستراتيجيات التسويقية لبرامج SaaS"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f8f91a7409a5b7f3802e3de3ce70458ae77f701ec67995b9cd0df52f5244f19a","qualityScore":46}');
