INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('remote-123/v0-real-estate-landing-page/marketing-ideas', 'marketing-ideas', 'remote-123', 'v0-real-estate-landing-page', 'community', 'marketing-ideas remote-123 v0-real-estate-landing-page community The marketing-ideas skill provides 139 proven marketing strategies for SaaS, helping users find the right approach for their specific situation, stage, and resources. It benefits marketing strategists and SaaS businesses. Marketing Ideas是139个经过验证的营销策略，帮助用户找到适合特定情况、阶段和资源的营销策略。使用product-marketing-context.md文件中的上下文来获得更好的结果。 Marketing Ideasは139の検証済みマーケティング戦略であり、ユーザーが特定の状況、段階、リソースに適したマーケティング戦略を見つけるのに役立ちます。product-marketing-context.mdファイルのコンテキストを使用して、より良い結果を得ることができます。 Marketing Ideas는 139개의 검증된 마케팅 전략으로, 사용자가 특정 상황, 단계 및 자원에 적합한 마케팅 전략을 찾는 데 도움이 됩니다. product-marketing-context.md 파일의 컨텍스트를 사용하여 더 나은 결과를 얻을 수 있습니다. La habilidad de marketing-ideas ofrece 139 ideas de marketing probadas para ayudar a los usuarios a encontrar las estrategias de marketing adecuadas para su situación específica La compétence marketing-ideas propose 139 idées de marketing éprouvées pour aider les utilisateurs à trouver les stratégies de marketing appropriées pour leur situation spécifique Die Fähigkeit marketing-ideas bietet 139 bewährte Marketingideen, um den Benutzern zu helfen, die richtigen Marketingstrategien für ihre spezifische Situation zu finden O skill Marketing-Ideas fornece 139 ideias de marketing comprovadas para ajudar os desenvolvedores a encontrar as estratégias certas para o seu negócio Навык Marketing-Ideas предоставляет 139 проверенных маркетинговых идей, чтобы помочь разработчикам найти правильные стратегии для своего бизнеса المهارة Marketing-Ideas توفر 139 فكرة تسويقية مثبتة لمساعدة المطورين على العثور على الاستراتيجيات المناسبة لأعمالهم how to use marketing-ideas what is marketing-ideas marketing-ideas alternative marketing-ideas vs competitor marketing-ideas install marketing-ideas setup guide SaaS marketing strategies product marketing context Marketing Ideas AI工具 营销策略 product-marketing-context.md CLI React Python AI营销 数字营销 Utilizes product marketing context from .agents/product-marketing-context.md files Provides 139 proven marketing ideas for SaaS Helps users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources Supports reading of .claude/product-marketing-context.md files in older setups Enables users to ask targeted questions based on existing context marketing-ideas is a skill that offers a library of proven marketing strategies for SaaS, utilizing product marketing context to inform campaign decisions.');
