["Bereitstellung von Monorepos mit Turborepo","Integration mit Astro für Landingpages","Verwendung von Hono für Registrierungs-API","Anbindung an Postgres als Datenbank","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität bei der Implementierung","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Implantação de monorepo com Turborepo","Criação de landing pages com Astro","Desenvolvimento de API de signup com Hono","Integração com Postgres","Otimização de desempenho com Turborepo"],"ru":["Развертывание монорепо с Turborepo","Создание лендингов с Astro","Разработка API регистрации с Hono","Интеграция с Postgres","Оптимизация производительности с Turborepo"],"ar":["توزيع مونوريبو مع تيربو ريبو","إنشاء صفحات هبوط مع أسترو","تطوير واجهة برمجة تطبيقات التسجيل مع هونو","التكامل مع بوستجرس","تحسين الأداء مع تيربو ريبو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Turborepo单体仓库","Astro登陆页面","Hono注册API","Postgres数据库","AI智能代理","快速部署","单体仓库部署","AI工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Turborepoモノレポ","Astroランディングページ","HonoサインアップAPI","Postgresデータベース","AIエージェント","迅速なデプロイ","モノレポデプロイ","AIツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Turborepo 모노레포","Astro 랜딩 페이지","Hono 가입 API","Postgres 데이터베이스","AI 에이전트","빠른 배포","모노레포 배포","AI 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["cómo desplegar Turborepo","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","Astro y Hono","monorepo con Turborepo","despliegue de aplicaciones escalables","Postgres como base de datos","alternativas a Turborepo","Turborepo vs otros monorepos"],"fr":["comment déployer Turborepo","outils d''intelligence artificielle","Astro et Hono","monorepo avec Turborepo","déploiement d''applications évolutives","Postgres comme base de données","alternatives à Turborepo","Turborepo vs autres monorepos"],"de":["wie man Turborepo bereitstellt","KI-Tools","Astro und Hono","Monorepo mit Turborepo","Bereitstellung von skalierbaren Anwendungen","Postgres als Datenbank","Alternativen zu Turborepo","Turborepo vs andere Monorepos"],"pt":["como usar turborepo","o que é monorepo","turborepo vs webpack","instalar turborepo","guias de configuração do astro","hono api signup"],"ru":["как использовать turborepo","что такое монорепо","turborepo vs webpack","установить turborepo","руководства по настройке astro","hono api регистрации"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام تيربو ريبو","ما هو مونوريبو","تيربو ريبو مقابل ويب باك","تثبيت تيربو ريبو","دليل إعداد أسترو","هونو واجهة برمجة تطبيقات التسجيل"]}},"owner":"sethdavis512","repo":"quick-landing-page","repoPath":"sethdavis512/quick-landing-page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:20:06.284Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deploy","description":"This skill should be used when the user wants to push code to Railway, says railway up, deploy, deploy to railway, ship, or push. For initial setup or creating services, use new skill. For Docker images, use environment skill.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- De","body":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- Describe what changed: \"Fix memory leak in worker process\"\n- Reference tickets/issues: \"Implement feature #123\"\n- Be concise but meaningful: \"Update deps and fix build warnings\"\n\n## Modes\n\n### Detach Mode (default)\nStarts deploy and returns immediately. Use for most deploys.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n### CI Mode\nStreams build logs until complete. Use when user wants to watch the build or needs to debug issues.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --ci -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n**When to use CI mode:**\n- User says \"deploy and watch\", \"deploy and fix issues\"\n- User is debugging build failures\n- User wants to see build output\n\n## Deploy Specific Service\n\nDefault is linked service. To deploy to a different service:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach --service backend -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n## Deploy to Unlinked Project\n\nDeploy to a project without linking first:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --project <project-id> --environment production --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\nRequires both `--project` and `--environment` flags.\n\n## CLI Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `-m, --message <MSG>` | Commit message describing the deploy (always use this) |\n| `-d, --detach` | Don''t attach to logs (default) |\n| `-c, --ci` | Stream build logs, exit when done |\n| `-s, --service <NAME>` | Target service (defaults to linked) |\n| `-e, --environment <NAME>` | Target environment (defaults to linked) |\n| `-p, --project <ID>` | Target project (requires --environment) |\n| `[PATH]` | Path to deploy (defaults to current directory) |\n\n## Directory Linking\n\nRailway CLI walks UP the directory tree to find a linked project. If you''re in a subdirectory of a linked project, you don''t need to relink.\n\nFor subdirectory deployments, prefer setting `rootDirectory` via the environment skill, then deploy normally with `railway up`.\n\n## After Deploy\n\n### Detach mode\n```\nDeploying to <service>...\n```\nUse `deployment` skill to check build status (with `--lines` flag).\n\n### CI mode\nBuild logs stream inline. If build fails, the error will be in the output.\n\n**Do NOT run `railway logs --build` after CI mode** - the logs already streamed. If you need\nmore context, use `deployment` skill with `--lines` flag (never stream).\n\n## Composability\n\n- **Check status after deploy**: Use `service` skill\n- **View logs**: Use `deployment` skill\n- **Fix config issues**: Use `environment` skill\n- **Redeploy after config fix**: Use `environment` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No Project Linked\n```\nNo Railway project linked. Run `railway link` first.\n```\n\n### No Service Linked\n```\nNo service linked. Use --service flag or run `railway service` to select one.\n```\n\n### Build Failure (CI mode)\nThe build logs already streamed - analyze them directly from the `railway up --ci` output.\nDo NOT run `railway logs` after CI mode (it streams forever without `--lines`).\n\nCommon issues:\n- Missing dependencies → check package.json/requirements.txt\n- Build command wrong → use environment skill to fix\n- Dockerfile issues → check dockerfile path\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T08:25:52.033Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined code deployment to Railway.","zh":"非常适合需要将代码部署到 Railway 的开发代理，能够简化代码部署流程。","ja":"Railway へのコードデプロイを効率化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Railway에 코드를 배포하는 것을 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una implementación de código simplificada en Railway.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''un déploiement de code simplifié vers Railway.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine vereinfachte Codebereitstellung auf Railway benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de implantação de código otimizada para Railway.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима оптимизированная развертка кода в Railway.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيون الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر رمز متدفق إلى Railway."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`, handling local code changes and commit messages with ease, leveraging Turborepo monorepo and Postgres.","zh":"赋予代理从当前目录部署代码到 Railway 的能力，使用 `railway up` 命令，轻松处理本地代码更改和提交消息，利用 Turborepo 单体仓库和 Postgres。","ja":"エージェントが `railway up` コマンドを使用して、現在のディレクトリから Railway にコードをデプロイできるようにし、ローカルのコード変更やコミットメッセージを容易に処理し、Turborepo モノレポと Postgres を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 현재 디렉토리에서 Railway로 코드를 배포할 수 있도록 하며, `railway up` 명령을 사용하여 로컬 코드 변경 및 커밋 메시지를 쉽게 처리하며, Turborepo 모노레포 및 Postgres를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar código desde el directorio actual en Railway utilizando `railway up`, manejando cambios de código local y mensajes de confirmación con facilidad, aprovechando Turborepo monorepo y Postgres.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer du code depuis le répertoire actuel sur Railway en utilisant `railway up`, gérant les modifications de code local et les messages de validation avec facilité, en exploitant Turborepo monorepo et Postgres.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Code aus dem aktuellen Verzeichnis auf Railway zu bereitstellen, indem `railway up` verwendet wird, lokale Codeänderungen und Commit-Nachrichten mühelos handhabend, Turborepo Monorepo und Postgres nutzend.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar código do diretório atual para Railway usando `railway up`, tratando alterações de código local e mensagens de commit com facilidade, aproveitando Turborepo monorepo e Postgres.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертки кода из текущего каталога в Railway с помощью `railway up`, обрабатывая локальные изменения кода и коммит-сообщения с легкостью, используя Turborepo monorepo и Postgres.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من نشر الرمز من الدليل الحالي إلى Railway باستخدام `railway up` ، ويعالج تغييرات الرمز المحلي ورسائل Commit بسهولة ، مستفيدًا من Turborepo monorepo و Postgres."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying Astro landing pages","Shipping Hono signup API updates","Pushing code changes to Railway"],"zh":["部署 Astro 登陆页面","交付 Hono 注册 API 更新","将代码更改推送到 Railway"],"ja":["Astro ランディングページのデプロイ","Hono サインアップ API の更新の配信","Railway へのコード変更のプッシュ"],"ko":["Astro 랜딩 페이지 배포","Hono 회원가입 API 업데이트 배포","Railway에 코드 변경 사항 푸시"],"es":["Implementar páginas de aterrizaje de Astro","Enviar actualizaciones de la API de registro de Hono","Enviar cambios de código a Railway"],"fr":["Déployer des pages d''atterrissage Astro","Expédier des mises à jour de l''API d''inscription Hono","Envoyer des modifications de code à Railway"],"de":["Astro-Landingpages bereitstellen","Hono-Signier-API-Updates versenden","Codeänderungen an Railway senden"],"pt":["Implantação de páginas de destino Astro","Envio de atualizações de API de inscrição Hono","Envio de alterações de código para Railway"],"ru":["Развертка страниц посадки Astro","Отправка обновлений API регистрации Hono","Отправка изменений кода в Railway"],"ar":["نشر صفحات هبوط Astro","شحن تحديثات API التسجيل Hono","دفع تغييرات الرمز إلى Railway"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway setup","Limited to Turborepo monorepo architecture","Dependent on Postgres database"],"zh":["需要 Railway 设置","仅限于 Turborepo 单体仓库架构","依赖于 Postgres 数据库"],"ja":["Railway の設定が必要","Turborepo モノレポアーキテクチャのみ対応","Postgres データベースに依存"],"ko":["Railway 설정이 필요함","Turborepo 모노레포 아키텍처만 지원","Postgres 데이터베이스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Railway","Limitado a la arquitectura de monorepo de Turborepo","Dependiente de la base de datos Postgres"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Railway","Limité à l''architecture de monorepo de Turborepo","Dépendant de la base de données Postgres"],"de":["Benötigt Railway-Setup","Begrenzt auf Turborepo-Monorepo-Architektur","Von Postgres-Datenbank abhängig"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Railway","Limitado à arquitetura de monorepo Turborepo","Dependente do banco de dados Postgres"],"ru":["Требует настройки Railway","Ограничен архитектурой монорепозитория Turborepo","Зависит от базы данных Postgres"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Railway","محدود بهيكل مستودع Turborepo","يعتمد على قاعدة بيانات Postgres"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8f76d1c79c47ec542bf17ac0ce554b560930e25f673f2ed74c7ed02a8619671f","qualityScore":46}');
