ce","manimce vs blender","manimce install","manimce setup guide","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["как использовать manimce","что такое manimce","manimce vs blender","manimce установка","manimce руководство по настройке","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","лучшие практики разработки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام منيمسي","ما هي منيمسي","منيمسي مقابل بلندر","منيمسي تثبيت","منيمسي دليل الإعداد","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","أفضل الممارسات للتطوير"]}},"owner":"adithya-s-k","repo":"manim_skill","repoPath":"adithya-s-k/manim_skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.900Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"manimce-best-practices","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n### Core Concepts\n- [rules/scenes.md](rules/scenes.md) - Scene structure, construct method, and scene types\n- [rules/mobjects.md](rules/mobjects.md) - Mobject types, VMobject, Groups, and positioning\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Animation classes, playing animations, and timing\n\n### Creation & Transformation\n- [rules/creation-animations.md](rules/creation-animations.md) - Create, Write, Fade","body":"## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n### Core Concepts\n- [rules/scenes.md](rules/scenes.md) - Scene structure, construct method, and scene types\n- [rules/mobjects.md](rules/mobjects.md) - Mobject types, VMobject, Groups, and positioning\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Animation classes, playing animations, and timing\n\n### Creation & Transformation\n- [rules/creation-animations.md](rules/creation-animations.md) - Create, Write, FadeIn, DrawBorderThenFill\n- [rules/transform-animations.md](rules/transform-animations.md) - Transform, ReplacementTransform, morphing\n- [rules/animation-groups.md](rules/animation-groups.md) - AnimationGroup, LaggedStart, Succession\n\n### Text & Math\n- [rules/text.md](rules/text.md) - Text mobjects, fonts, and styling\n- [rules/latex.md](rules/latex.md) - MathTex, Tex, LaTeX rendering, and coloring formulas\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Write, AddTextLetterByLetter, TypeWithCursor\n\n### Styling & Appearance\n- [rules/colors.md](rules/colors.md) - Color constants, gradients, and color manipulation\n- [rules/styling.md](rules/styling.md) - Fill, stroke, opacity, and visual properties\n\n### Positioning & Layout\n- [rules/positioning.md](rules/positioning.md) - move_to, next_to, align_to, shift methods\n- [rules/grouping.md](rules/grouping.md) - VGroup, Group, arrange, and layout patterns\n\n### Coordinate Systems & Graphing\n- [rules/axes.md](rules/axes.md) - Axes, NumberPlane, coordinate systems\n- [rules/graphing.md](rules/graphing.md) - Plotting functions, parametric curves\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - ThreeDScene, 3D axes, surfaces, camera orientation\n\n### Animation Control\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Rate functions, easing, run_time, lag_ratio\n- [rules/updaters.md](rules/updaters.md) - Updaters, ValueTracker, dynamic animations\n- [rules/camera.md](rules/camera.md) - MovingCameraScene, zoom, pan, frame manipulation\n\n### Configuration & CLI\n- [rules/cli.md](rules/cli.md) - Command-line interface, rendering options, quality flags\n- [rules/config.md](rules/config.md) - Configuration system, manim.cfg, settings\n\n### Shapes & Geometry\n- [rules/shapes.md](rules/shapes.md) - Circle, Square, Rectangle, Polygon, and geometric primitives\n- [rules/lines.md](rules/lines.md) - Line, Arrow, Vector, DashedLine, and connectors\n\n## Working Examples\n\nComplete, tested example files demonstrating common patterns:\n\n- [examples/basic_animations.py](examples/basic_animations.py) - Shape creation, text, lagged animations, path movement\n- [examples/math_visualization.py](examples/math_visualization.py) - LaTeX equations, color-coded math, derivations\n- [examples/updater_patterns.py](examples/updater_patterns.py) - ValueTracker, dynamic animations, physics simulations\n- [examples/graph_plotting.py](examples/graph_plotting.py) - Axes, functions, areas, Riemann sums, polar plots\n- [examples/3d_visualization.py](examples/3d_visualization.py) - ThreeDScene, surfaces, 3D camera, parametric curves\n\n## Scene Templates\n\nCopy and modify these templates to start new projects:\n\n- [templates/basic_scene.py](templates/basic_scene.py) - Standard 2D scene template\n- [templates/camera_scene.py](templates/camera_scene.py) - MovingCameraScene with zoom/pan\n- [templates/threed_scene.py](templates/threed_scene.py) - 3D scene with surfaces and camera rotation\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Basic Scene Structure\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass MyScene(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Create mobjects\n        circle = Circle()\n\n        # Add to scene (static)\n        self.add(circle)\n\n        # Or animate\n        self.play(Create(circle))\n\n        # Wait\n        self.wait(1)\n```\n\n### Render Command\n```bash\n# Basic render with preview\nmanim -pql scene.py MyScene\n\n# Quality flags: -ql (low), -qm (medium), -qh (high), -qk (4k)\nmanim -pqh scene.py MyScene\n```\n\n### Key Differences from 3b1b/ManimGL\n\n| Feature | Manim Community | 3b1b/ManimGL |\n|---------|-----------------|--------------|\n| Import | `from manim import *` | `from manimlib import *` |\n| CLI | `manim` | `manimgl` |\n| Math text | `MathTex(r\"\\pi\")` | `Tex(R\"\\pi\")` |\n| Scene | `Scene` | `InteractiveScene` |\n| Package | `manim` (PyPI) | `manimgl` (PyPI) |\n\n### Jupyter Notebook Support\n\nUse the `%%manim` cell magic:\n\n```python\n%%manim -qm MyScene\nclass MyScene(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        self.play(Create(Circle()))\n```\n\n### Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n1. **Version confusion** - Ensure you''re using `manim` (Community), not `manimgl` (3b1b version)\n2. **Check imports** - `from manim import *` is ManimCE; `from manimlib import *` is ManimGL\n3. **Outdated tutorials** - Video tutorials may be outdated; prefer official documentation\n4. **manimpango issues** - If text rendering fails, check manimpango installation requirements\n5. **PATH issues (Windows)** - If `manim` command not found, use `python -m manim` or check PATH\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# Install Manim Community\npip install manim\n\n# Check installation\nmanim checkhealth\n```\n\n### Useful Commands\n\n```bash\nmanim -pql scene.py Scene    # Preview low quality (development)\nmanim -pqh scene.py Scene    # Preview high quality\nmanim --format gif scene.py  # Output as GIF\nmanim checkhealth            # Verify installation\nmanim plugins -l             # List plugins\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:56:49.509Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Animation Agents needing advanced 3Blue1Brown style animation capabilities with Manim.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Manim进行高级3Blue1Brown风格动画能力的动画代理","ja":"Manimを使用した高度な3Blue1Brownスタイルのアニメーション機能を必要とするアニメーションエージェントに最適","ko":"Manim을 사용하여 고급 3Blue1Brown 스타일 애니메이션 기능을 필요한 애니메이션 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Animación que necesitan capacidades de animación avanzadas de estilo 3Blue1Brown con Manim.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Animation ayant besoin de capacités d''animation avancées de style 3Blue1Brown avec Manim.","de":"Perfekt für Animationsagenten, die erweiterte Animationsfunktionen im Stil von 3Blue1Brown mit Manim benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Animação que necessitam de capacidades de animação avançadas no estilo 3Blue1Brown com Manim.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анимации, требующих расширенных возможностей анимации в стиле 3Blue1Brown с Manim.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الرسوم المتحركة الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности رسوم متحركة متقدمة بنمط 3Blue1Brown مع Manim."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate complex animations using Manim''s scene structure, mobject types, and animation classes, including creation animations like Create, Write, and Fade, and leverages VMobject, Groups, and positioning for precise control.","zh":"赋予代理生成复杂动画的能力，使用Manim的场景结构、mobject类型和动画类，包括创建动画，如Create、Write和Fade，并利用VMobject、Groups和定位实现精确控制","ja":"Manimのシーン構造、mobjectタイプ、そしてアニメーションクラスを使用して、エージェントが複雑なアニメーションを生成できるようにし、Create、Write、Fadeなどのアニメーションを作成し、VMobject、Groups、位置指定を使用して精密な制御を行う","ko":"Manim의 장면 구조, 모바일 개체 유형 및 애니메이션 클래스를 사용하여 복잡한 애니메이션을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고 Create, Write 및 Fade와 같은 애니메이션을 생성하고 VMobject, 그룹 및 위치 지정으로 정밀한 제어를 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar animaciones complejas utilizando la estructura de escena de Manim, los tipos de mobject y las clases de animación, incluyendo animaciones de creación como Create, Write y Fade, y aprovecha VMobject, Groups y posición para un control preciso.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des animations complexes en utilisant la structure de scène de Manim, les types de mobject et les classes d''animation, notamment la création d''animations comme Create, Write et Fade, et tire parti de VMobject, Groups et positionnement pour un contrôle précis.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Animationen zu erstellen, indem sie die Szenenstruktur von Manim, die Mobject-Typen und die Animationsklassen verwenden, einschließlich Erstellungsanimationen wie Create, Write und Fade, und nutzt VMobject, Gruppen und Positionierung für eine präzise Kontrolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar animações complexas usando a estrutura de cena do Manim, tipos de mobject e classes de animação, incluindo criação de animações como Create, Write e Fade, e aproveita VMobject, Groups e posicionamento para controle preciso.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать сложные анимации, используя структуру сцены Manim, типы mobject и классы анимации, включая создание анимаций, таких как Create, Write и Fade, и использует VMobject, Groups и позиционирование для точного контроля.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة معقدة باستخدام هيكل المشهد في Manim و أنواع mobject و فئات الرسوم المتحركة، بما في ذلك إنشاء رسوم متحركة مثل Create و Write و Fade، وتользовة VMobject و Groups و التموضع للحصول على التحكم الدقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating educational animations with custom scenes and mobjects","Creating interactive animations with precise timing and control","Automating animation production using Manim''s built-in animation classes"],"zh":["使用自定义场景和mobjects生成教育动画","创建交互式动画，具有精确的时序和控制","使用Manim的内置动画类自动化动画制作"],"ja":["カスタムシーンとmobjectsを使用して教育アニメーションを生成する","正確なタイミングと制御を持つインタラクティブアニメーションを作成する","Manimのビルトインアニメーションクラスを使用してアニメーション制作を自動化する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 장면 및 모바일 개체를 사용하여 교육 애니메이션을 생성","정확한 타이밍 및 제어와 함께 상호 작용 애니메이션을 생성","Manim의 내장 애니메이션 클래스를 사용하여 애니메이션 제작 자동화"],"es":["Generar animaciones educativas con escenas y mobjects personalizados","Crear animaciones interactivas con temporización y control precisos","Automatizar la producción de animaciones mediante las clases de animación integradas de Manim"],"fr":["Générer des animations éducatives avec des scènes et des mobjects personnalisés","Créer des animations interactives avec une temporisation et un contrôle précis","Automatiser la production d''animations à l''aide des classes d''animation intégrées de Manim"],"de":["Erstellen von Bildungsanimationen mit benutzerdefinierten Szenen und Mobjects","Erstellen von interaktiven Animationen mit präziser Zeitsteuerung und Kontrolle","Automatisieren der Animationsproduktion mithilfe der integrierten Animationsklassen von Manim"],"pt":["Geração de animações educacionais com cenas e mobjects personalizados","Criação de animações interativas com temporização e controle precisos","Automação da produção de animações usando as classes de animação internas do Manim"],"ru":["Генерация образовательных анимаций с пользовательскими сценами и mobject","Создание интерактивных анимаций с точным таймингом и контролем","Автоматизация производства анимаций с использованием встроенных классов анимации Manim"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم متحركة تعليمية مع مشاهد و mobjects مخصصة","إنشاء رسوم متحركة تفاعلية مع توقيت و تحكم دقيقين","آليّة إنتاج الرسوم المتحركة باستخدام فئات الرسوم المتحركة المدمجة في Manim"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Manim installation and configuration","Python programming knowledge necessary","Limited to 2D animations"],"zh":["需要Manim安装和配置","需要Python编程知识","仅限2D动画"],"ja":["Manimのインストールと構成が必要","Pythonプログラミングの知識が必要","2Dアニメーションのみ"],"ko":["Manim 설치 및 구성 필요","Python 프로그래밍 지식 필요","2D 애니메이션만"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Manim","Conocimientos de programación en Python necesarios","Limitado a animaciones 2D"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Manim","Connaissances de programmation en Python nécessaires","Limité aux animations 2D"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von Manim","Python-Programmierkenntnisse erforderlich","Begrenzt auf 2D-Animationen"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Manim","Conhecimento de programação Python necessário","Limitado a animações 2D"],"ru":["Требуется установка и настройка Manim","Необходимо знание языка программирования Python","Ограничен до анимаций 2D"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Manim وضبطه","مطلوب معرفة لغة البرمجة Python","محدود بالرسوم المتحركة ثنائية الأبعاد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ae09751ec9e3e9389b85f923f4e34b706a32e01b18e378759163d1d855f90d4e","qualityScore":46}');
