 delta_export","Téléchargement de données et transformation avec des modèles dbt"],"de":["Ausführung von dbt innerhalb eines Microsoft Fabric Python-Notebooks","Verwendung von DuckDB als Compute-Engine","Integration mit DuckLake für die Verwaltung von Delta Lake-Tabellen","Installation der delta_export-Erweiterung","Datenherunterladen und Transformation mit dbt-Modellen"],"pt":["Execução de pipeline dbt completo dentro de um notebook Python do Microsoft Fabric","Utilização de DuckDB como mecanismo de computação","Integração com DuckLake para gerenciamento de tabelas Delta Lake","Instalação de extensão delta_export","Transformação de dados com modelos dbt"],"ru":["Запуск полного пайплайна dbt внутри ноутбука Python от Microsoft Fabric","Использование DuckDB в качестве вычислительного механизма","Интеграция с DuckLake для управления таблицами Delta Lake","Установка расширения delta_export","Преобразование данных с помощью моделей dbt"],"ar":["تشغيل pipeline dbt كامل داخل notebook Python من Microsoft Fabric","استخدام DuckDB كمحرك حاسوبي","التكامل مع DuckLake لإدارة جداول Delta Lake","تثبيت امتداد delta_export","تحويل البيانات باستخدام نماذج dbt"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dbt-fabric-notebook","dbt-fabric-notebook setup guide","dbt-fabric-notebook vs dbt-core","dbt-fabric-notebook install","what is dbt-fabric-notebook","dbt-fabric-notebook alternative","running dbt in Microsoft Fabric","DuckDB and DuckLake integration","dbt pipeline management"],"zh":["dbt-fabric-notebook","Microsoft Fabric","dbt.pipeline","DuckDB","DuckLake","Delta Lake","AI 工具","数据处理","数据转换"],"ja":["dbt-fabric-notebook","Microsoft Fabric","dbt パイプライン","DuckDB","DuckLake","Delta Lake","AI エージェント","データ処理","データ変換"],"ko":["dbt-fabric-notebook","Microsoft Fabric","dbt 파이프라인","DuckDB","DuckLake","Delta Lake","AI 도구","데이터 처리","데이터 변환"],"es":["dbt-fabric-notebook","Microsoft Fabric","DuckDB","DuckLake","Delta Lake","pipeline dbt","desarrollo de datos","herramientas de AI","agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["dbt-fabric-notebook","Microsoft Fabric","DuckDB","DuckLake","Delta Lake","pipeline dbt","développement de données","outils d''IA","agents d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["dbt-fabric-notebook","Microsoft Fabric","DuckDB","DuckLake","Delta Lake","dbt-Pipeline","Datenentwicklung","KI-Tools","Künstliche Intelligenz Agenten"],"pt":["dbt-fabric-notebook","pipeline dbt","DuckDB","DuckLake","notebook Python","Microsoft Fabric","desenvolvimento de dados","engenharia de dados","ferramentas de dados"],"ru":["dbt-fabric-notebook","пайплайн dbt","DuckDB","DuckLake","ноутбук Python","Microsoft Fabric","разработка данных","инженерия данных","инструменты данных","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["dbt-fabric-notebook","pipeline dbt","DuckDB","DuckLake","notebook Python","Microsoft Fabric","برمجة البيانات","هندسة البيانات","أدوات البيانات","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"]}},"owner":"djouallah","repo":"dbt","repoPath":"djouallah/dbt","stars":3,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T01:12:16Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dbt-fabric-notebook","description":"Guide for running dbt inside Microsoft Fabric Python notebooks using DuckDB, DuckLake, and Delta Lake export. Trigger when user asks about dbt in Fabric, dbt-duckdb in notebooks, or DuckLake with Fabric.","bodyPreview":"# Running dbt inside a Microsoft Fabric Python Notebook\n\nThis skill explains how to run a full dbt pipeline inside a Microsoft Fabric Python notebook using DuckDB as the compute engine and DuckLake for Delta Lake table management.\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nFabric Notebook (ephemeral Python session)\n  -> pip install duckdb, dbt-duckdb\n  -> dbt run (DuckDB in-memory + DuckLake extension)\n       -> on-run-start: installs delta_export extension, downloads data\n       -> Transforms with dbt models (incre","body":"# Running dbt inside a Microsoft Fabric Python Notebook\n\nThis skill explains how to run a full dbt pipeline inside a Microsoft Fabric Python notebook using DuckDB as the compute engine and DuckLake for Delta Lake table management.\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nFabric Notebook (ephemeral Python session)\n  -> pip install duckdb, dbt-duckdb\n  -> dbt run (DuckDB in-memory + DuckLake extension)\n       -> on-run-start: installs delta_export extension, downloads data\n       -> Transforms with dbt models (incremental by file)\n       -> DuckLake writes Parquet to abfss://.../<lakehouse>/Tables/\n       -> on-run-end: CALL delta_export() writes Delta Lake _delta_log\n  -> Fabric / Power BI reads Delta tables natively\n```\n\nKey insight: DuckDB runs **in-memory** inside the notebook. DuckLake stores data as Parquet on OneLake (abfss://) and keeps metadata in a local SQLite file. The `delta_export` DuckDB extension converts DuckLake metadata into Delta Lake transaction logs — no separate Python package needed. Everything runs inside `dbt run`.\n\n## Notebook Template (4 cells)\n\n### Cell 1 — Install dependencies\n```python\n!pip install -q duckdb==1.4.4\n!pip install -q dbt-duckdb\nimport sys\nsys.exit(0)  # Restart kernel to pick up new packages\n```\n\n### Cell 2 — Environment variables\n```python\nimport os\nos.environ[''DBT_SCHEMA'']          = ''my_schema''\nos.environ[''ROOT_PATH'']           = ''abfss://<workspace>@onelake.dfs.fabric.microsoft.com/<lakehouse>.Lakehouse''\nos.environ[''download_limit'']      = ''100''\nos.environ[''process_limit'']       = ''100''\nos.environ[''METADATA_LOCAL_PATH''] = ''/synfs/nb_resource/builtin/metadata.db''\n```\n\n| Variable | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| `DBT_SCHEMA` | Target schema name in DuckLake |\n| `ROOT_PATH` | abfss:// path to the Fabric lakehouse root |\n| `download_limit` | Max files to download per source per run |\n| `process_limit` | Max files to process per model per run (default: 100) |\n| `METADATA_LOCAL_PATH` | Local path for DuckLake SQLite metadata DB. Use `/synfs/nb_resource/builtin/` in Fabric — this persists across notebook sessions |\n\n### Cell 3 — Clone dbt project\n\n**Public repo:**\n```python\n!git clone --branch production --single-branch https://github.com/<your-repo>.git /tmp/dbt\n```\n\n**Private repo (production):**\n```python\npat = mssparkutils.credentials.getSecret(''https://<vault-name>.vault.azure.net/'', ''github-pat'')\n!git clone --branch production --single-branch https://{pat}@github.com/<your-repo>.git /tmp/dbt\n```\n\nFor private repos, store a GitHub fine-grained PAT (with `Contents: Read` permission) in Azure Key Vault. Grant the Fabric workspace identity `Key Vault Secrets User` access.\n\n### Cell 4 — Run dbt\n```python\n!cd /tmp/dbt && dbt run && dbt test\n```\n\nDelta export happens automatically via the `on-run-end` hook — no separate step needed.\n\n## profiles.yml Configuration\n\n```yaml\nmy_project:\n  target: dev\n  outputs:\n    dev:\n      type: duckdb\n      path: '':memory:''\n      database: ducklake\n      threads: 1\n      schema: \"{{ env_var(''DBT_SCHEMA'', ''default'') }}\"\n      config_options:\n        allow_unsigned_extensions: true\n      settings:\n        preserve_insertion_order: false\n      extensions:\n        - parquet\n        - sqlite\n        - azure\n        - httpfs\n        - json\n        - ducklake\n        - name: zipfs\n          repo: community\n        - name: delta_export\n          repo: community\n      attach:\n        - path: \"ducklake:sqlite:{{ env_var(''METADATA_LOCAL_PATH'', ''/tmp/ducklake_metadata.db'') }}\"\n          alias: ducklake\n          options:\n            data_path: \"{{ env_var(''ROOT_PATH'') }}/Tables\"\n            data_inlining_row_limit: 0\n```\n\nKey points:\n- `path: '':memory:''` — DuckDB runs fully in-memory, no local database file\n- `database: ducklake` — tells dbt to target the attached DuckLake catalog\n- `config_options.allow_unsigned_extensions: true` — must be set at connection creation time (not `settings`) to allow community extensions\n- `settings.preserve_insertion_order: false` — reduces memory usage by allowing DuckDB to reorder results\n- `data_path` points to `abfss://.../<lakehouse>/Tables` where Parquet data lives\n- `data_inlining_row_limit: 0` — disables data inlining (small writes go to Parquet, not metadata)\n- Extensions: `azure` for abfss://, `httpfs` for HTTP downloads, `zipfs` for reading CSVs from ZIPs\n\n## dbt_project.yml — Delta Export & DuckLake Maintenance\n\n```yaml\non-run-start:\n  - \"CALL ducklake.set_option(''rewrite_delete_threshold'', 0)\"\n  - \"CALL ducklake.set_option(''target_file_size'', ''128MB'')\"\n  - \"{{ download() }}\"   # your data ingestion macro\n\non-run-end:\n  - \"CALL ducklake_rewrite_data_files(''ducklake'')\"\n  - \"CALL ducklake_merge_adjacent_files(''ducklake'')\"\n  - \"CALL delta_export()\"\n```\n\n`delta_export` is now a **community extension** — installed via `profiles.yml` extensions list (no manual INSTALL/LOAD needed). At run end, DuckLake maintenance compacts data files before `delta_export()` writes Delta Lake transaction logs.\n\n**Why delta_export is mandatory:** DuckLake is not natively supported by Spark, Power BI, or any other engine in Microsoft Fabric. Without `delta_export`, the Parquet files written by DuckLake are invisible to the rest of the platform. The Delta Lake transaction logs (`_delta_log/`) make the tables readable as standard Delta tables by Power BI, Spark, SQL Analytics, and any Delta-compatible tool.\n\n### DuckLake Maintenance (on-run-end)\n\n| Call | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `ducklake_rewrite_data_files(''ducklake'')` | Rewrites files with deletes (threshold controlled by `rewrite_delete_threshold`) |\n| `ducklake_merge_adjacent_files(''ducklake'')` | Merges small Parquet files into larger ones (target size from `target_file_size`) |\n| `delta_export()` | Writes Delta Lake `_delta_log/` so Fabric/Power BI reads tables natively |\n\n### DuckLake Options\n\n| Option | Value | How to Set | Why |\n|--------|-------|------------|-----|\n| `data_inlining_row_limit` | 0 | ATTACH option in profiles.yml | Disable storing small inserts in metadata DB |\n| `rewrite_delete_threshold` | 0 | `set_option` in on-run-start (not an ATTACH param) | Rewrite all files with any deletes |\n| `target_file_size` | 128MB | `set_option` in on-run-start (not an ATTACH param) | Target Parquet file size for insert and compaction (default 512MB, reduced to prevent OOM) |\n\nNote: `target_file_size` controls both `merge_adjacent_files` merge target and auto-splitting of large inserts. It cannot be set via ATTACH options — must use `set_option`.\n\n## Schema Separation (raw + aemo)\n\nSeparate intermediate tables from Power BI-facing tables using dbt schema config:\n\n- **`aemo`** schema (default from `DBT_SCHEMA`): dim_calendar, dim_duid, fct_summary — exposed to Power BI\n- **`raw`** schema: fct_scada, fct_scada_today, fct_price, fct_price_today, stg_csv_archive_log — intermediate\n\n**dbt_project.yml:**\n```yaml\nmodels:\n  aemo_electricity:\n    staging:\n      +materialized: view\n      +schema: raw\n    dimensions:\n      +materialized: table\n    marts:\n      +materialized: incremental\n      +schema: raw\n```\n\nOverride specific models back to `aemo`: `{{ config(schema=''aemo'') }}` in `fct_summary.sql`.\n\n**Custom schema macro required** (`macros/generate_schema_name.sql`):\n```sql\n{% macro generate_schema_name(custom_schema_name, node) -%}\n    {%- if custom_schema_name is none -%}\n        {{ target.schema }}\n    {%- else -%}\n        {{ custom_schema_name | trim }}\n    {%- endif -%}\n{%- endmacro %}\n```\nWithout this, dbt prefixes the target schema (e.g., `aemo_raw` instead of `raw`).\n\n## Semantic Model (model.bim)\n\nDeploy via Fabric REST API using **TMSL format (model.bim)** — TMDL create is NOT supported by the API.\n\nKey requirements for Direct Lake on OneLake (no SQL endpoint):\n- `PBI_ProTooling` annotation with `DirectLakeOnOneLakeCreatedInDesktop`\n- `sourceLineageTag` on all tables (`[schema].[table]`) and columns\n- `relyOnReferentialIntegrity` on all relationships\n- `PBI_RemovedChildren` on expression listing excluded tables with correct schema prefix\n- Partition `schemaName` must match the lakehouse schema folder name\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Metadata persistence in Fabric\nDuckLake''s SQLite metadata DB needs a local filesystem. In Fabric notebooks, use `/synfs/nb_resource/builtin/` — this is the notebook resource folder that persists across sessions. Set `METADATA_LOCAL_PATH` to a file in that folder.\n\n### Incremental by file with process_limit\nTrack which source files have been processed using a `file` column in each fact table. Pre-hooks use DuckDB `SET VARIABLE` to pass only unprocessed file paths, capped by `process_limit`:\n\n```sql\n{{ config(\n    materialized=''incremental'',\n    unique_key=[''file'', ''DUID'', ''SETTLEMENTDATE''],\n    pre_hook=\"SET VARIABLE paths = (\n      SELECT list(...)\n      FROM (\n        SELECT source_filename\n        FROM {{ ref(''stg_archive_log'') }}\n        WHERE source_type = ''daily''\n        {% if is_incremental() %}\n          AND source_filename NOT IN (SELECT DISTINCT file FROM {{ this }})\n        {% endif %}\n        LIMIT {{ env_var(''process_limit'', ''100'') }}\n      )\n    )\"\n) }}\n```\n\n### Reading CSVs from ZIP archives\nDuckDB can read CSVs directly from ZIP files on remote storage:\n\n```sql\nSELECT * FROM read_csv(\n    getvariable(''paths''),\n    ignore_errors=true,\n    null_padding=true\n)\n```\n\n## Reference\nSee [reference.md](reference.md) for full code examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:03:54.931Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced dbt pipeline integration within Microsoft Fabric Python notebooks.","zh":"适用于需要在Microsoft Fabric Python笔记本中集成高级dbt pipeline的数据分析代理。","ja":"Microsoft Fabric Pythonノートブック内で高度なdbtパイプライン統合を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Microsoft Fabric Python 노트북 내에서 고급 dbt 파이프라인 통합이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan una integración avanzada de la canalización dbt dentro de los cuadernos de Python de Microsoft Fabric.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant une intégration avancée de la pipeline dbt au sein des cahiers Python Microsoft Fabric.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die eine erweiterte dbt-Pipeline-Integration innerhalb von Microsoft Fabric Python-Notebooks benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de integração avançada de pipeline dbt dentro de notebooks Python do Microsoft Fabric.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым необходима продвинутая интеграция конвейера dbt в тетрадях Python Microsoft Fabric.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل متقدم لخط أنابيب dbt داخل دفاتر Python من Microsoft Fabric."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run full dbt pipelines using DuckDB as the compute engine and DuckLake for Delta Lake table management, enabling seamless data transformation and analysis within Microsoft Fabric.","zh":"赋予代理在Microsoft Fabric中使用DuckDB作为计算引擎和DuckLake进行Delta Lake表管理，运行完整的dbt管道，从而实现无缝的数据转换和分析。","ja":"エージェントがMicrosoft Fabric内でDuckDBをコンピュートエンジンとして、DuckLakeをDelta Lakeテーブル管理として使用し、完全なdbtパイプラインを実行できるようになり、シームレスなデータ変換と分析が可能になります。","ko":"에이전트가 Microsoft Fabric 내에서 DuckDB를 컴퓨팅 엔진으로, DuckLake를 Delta Lake 테이블 관리로 사용하여 전체 dbt 파이프라인을 실행할 수 있으며, 무결점의 데이터 변환 및 분석을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pipelines dbt completos utilizando DuckDB como motor de cómputo y DuckLake para la gestión de tablas Delta Lake, lo que permite una transformación y análisis de datos sin problemas dentro de Microsoft Fabric.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des pipelines dbt complets en utilisant DuckDB comme moteur de calcul et DuckLake pour la gestion des tables Delta Lake, permettant ainsi une transformation et une analyse de données sans accroc au sein de Microsoft Fabric.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vollständige dbt-Pipelines mithilfe von DuckDB als Compute-Engine und DuckLake für die Verwaltung von Delta-Lake-Tabellen auszuführen, wodurch eine nahtlose DatenTransformation und -Analyse innerhalb von Microsoft Fabric ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar pipelines dbt completos usando DuckDB como motor de computação e DuckLake para gerenciamento de tabelas Delta Lake, permitindo transformação e análise de dados sem interrupções dentro do Microsoft Fabric.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать полные конвейеры dbt, используя DuckDB в качестве движка вычислений и DuckLake для управления таблицами Delta Lake, что обеспечивает бесперебойную трансформацию и анализ данных внутри Microsoft Fabric.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل خطوط أنابيب dbt الكاملة باستخدام DuckDB كمحرك حوسبة و DuckLake لإدارة جداول Delta Lake ، مما يتيح تحويل البيانات وتحليلها دون انقطاع داخل Microsoft Fabric."},"useCases":{"en":["Running dbt pipelines inside Microsoft Fabric Python notebooks","Transforming data with dbt models using DuckDB and DuckLake","Managing Delta Lake tables with DuckLake extension"],"zh":["在Microsoft Fabric Python笔记本中运行dbt管道","使用DuckDB和DuckLake的dbt模型转换数据","使用DuckLake扩展管理Delta Lake表"],"ja":["Microsoft Fabric Pythonノートブック内でdbtパイプラインを実行する","DuckDBとDuckLakeのdbtモデルを使用してデータを変換する","DuckLake拡張機能を使用してDelta Lakeテーブルを管理する"],"ko":["Microsoft Fabric Python 노트북 내에서 dbt 파이프라인을 실행하는 것","DuckDB 및 DuckLake의 dbt 모델을 사용하여 데이터를 변환하는 것","DuckLake 확장 기능을 사용하여 Delta Lake 테이블을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar pipelines dbt dentro de los cuadernos de Python de Microsoft Fabric","Transformar datos con modelos dbt mediante DuckDB y DuckLake","Gestionar tablas Delta Lake con la extensión DuckLake"],"fr":["Exécuter des pipelines dbt à l''intérieur des cahiers Python Microsoft Fabric","Transformer des données avec des modèles dbt en utilisant DuckDB et DuckLake","Gérer des tables Delta Lake avec l''extension DuckLake"],"de":["dbt-Pipelines innerhalb von Microsoft Fabric Python-Notebooks ausführen","Daten mit dbt-Modellen unter Verwendung von DuckDB und DuckLake transformieren","Delta-Lake-Tabellen mit der DuckLake-Erweiterung verwalten"],"pt":["Execução de pipelines dbt dentro de notebooks Python do Microsoft Fabric","Transformação de dados com modelos dbt usando DuckDB e DuckLake","Gerenciamento de tabelas Delta Lake com extensão DuckLake"],"ru":["Запуск конвейеров dbt внутри тетрадей Python Microsoft Fabric","Преобразование данных с помощью моделей dbt, используя DuckDB и DuckLake","Управление таблицами Delta Lake с помощью расширения DuckLake"],"ar":["تشغيل خطوط أنابيب dbt داخل دفاتر Python من Microsoft Fabric","تحويل البيانات باستخدام نماذج dbt باستخدام DuckDB و DuckLake","إدارة جداول Delta Lake باستخدام ملحق DuckLake"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Microsoft Fabric Python notebook environment","Dependent on DuckDB and DuckLake libraries","Limited to dbt pipeline execution within notebook sessions"],"zh":["需要Microsoft Fabric Python笔记本环境","依赖DuckDB和DuckLake库","仅限于笔记本会话内的dbt管道执行"],"ja":["Microsoft Fabric Pythonノートブック環境が必要","DuckDBとDuckLakeライブラリに依存","ノートブックセッション内でのdbtパイプライン実行のみ"],"ko":["Microsoft Fabric Python 노트북 환경이 필요함","DuckDB 및 DuckLake 라이브러리에 의존함","노트북 세션 내에서만 dbt 파이프라인을 실행할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de cuaderno de Python de Microsoft Fabric","Dependiente de las bibliotecas DuckDB y DuckLake","Limitado a la ejecución de pipelines dbt dentro de las sesiones de cuaderno"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de cahier Python Microsoft Fabric","Dépendant des bibliothèques DuckDB et DuckLake","Limité à l''exécution de pipelines dbt au sein des sessions de cahier"],"de":["Benötigt eine Microsoft Fabric Python-Notebook-Umgebung","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken DuckDB und DuckLake","Begrenzt auf die Ausführung von dbt-Pipelines innerhalb von Notebook-Sitzungen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de notebook Python do Microsoft Fabric","Dependente das bibliotecas DuckDB e DuckLake","Limitado à execução de pipelines dbt dentro de sessões de notebook"],"ru":["Требует среды тетради Python Microsoft Fabric","